# DS-0002: "Specify at least 1 USER command in Dockerfile with non-root user"
# False positive for us: every shipped image's final stage is
# gcr.io/distroless/{static,cc-debian12}:nonroot, which already bakes in
# USER 65532 at the base-image level. Trivy's Dockerfile linter only parses
# the Dockerfile text and doesn't resolve the inherited USER from a remote
# base image, so it flags these even though the running container is
# genuinely non-root. Revisit if any final stage stops using a nonroot base.
DS-0002
